# [[ .Name ]]

A [Quanarch](https://quanarch.org) qua: the contract between quans and a quanar.

- `src/index.ts` declares the API. Quans call it, the quanar implements it.
- `npm run build` writes the package to `dist/`.

Wire it into a quanar or a quan on disk:

```sh
qu new quanar main --stack react-ts --qua ./[[ .Name ]]
qu new quan billing --stack react-ts --qua ./[[ .Name ]]
```

Once published to a registry, refer to it as `--qua [[ .Name ]]@1`.
